# SABLE: coloured doors want their card (only the green one is needed to
# reach Cipher; red and blue open side rooms of supplies). A grenade opens
# a cracked wall. Cipher (26) blinks between terminals and can only be hurt
# while he shows: a grenade does 10, a pistol round 3.
seed 1
game echounit
wait 5
cheat mission 3
cheat god
wait 10
# the green door into Cipher's room
cheat spos 97 34
cheat sroomoff
hold RIGHT 40
expect s_room_x == 4
cheat scards 1
hold RIGHT 40
expect s_room_x == 5
expect s_boss_hp == 26
# a cracked wall in the guard post (H): a grenade, and it gives
cheat spos 93 17
cheat sroomoff
expect s_tile_97_17 == 119
cheat sammo 3 2
cheat sweapon 3
cheat sdir 0
press A 1
wait 40
expect s_tile_97_17 == 46
expect s_ammo3 == 1
# Cipher, worn down by the demo player
cheat scards 1
cheat spos 97 34
cheat sammo 1 9
botuntil s_room_x == 5 600
expect s_boss_hp == 26
botuntil s_boss_dead == 1 6000
botuntil state == 7 600
expect cleared3 == 1
